  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation CSO support 2014-2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering CSO st&#xf6;d 2014-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sedan 2013 arbetar ambassaden i Addis Abeba med st&#xf6;d till 5 paraply-organisationer inom civila samh&#xe4;llet. Planen &#xe4;r att g&#xf6;ra en gemensam slututv&#xe4;rdering av dessa, i stort i enlighet med DACs kriterier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since 2013 the Embassy in Addis Ababa is working with 5 agreements with umbrella organsations to support CSO-work in Ethiopia. The plan is to make a joint end-evaluation of this work using the  DAC criteria f&#xf6;r evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
